ind":"announcement","title":"🍜Gameplay Video & Livestream Guidelines🍜","summary":"Thank you for your interest in My Yokai Boyfriend: ILOVERAMEN!We warmly welcome gameplay videos and livestreams of this game! Please enjoy playing at your own pace.Before posting gameplay videos or livestreaming, please read the following guidelines.■ Permitted Gameplay Coverage【Before Release】 You may post videos or livestream content within the scope of the Steam demo.Specifically, you may cover the beginning of My Yokai Boyfriend 2 through the scene after Tambourine appears, stopping just bef","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:58:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1846651706688660","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜Character Introduction｜Meruru🍜","summary":"Meruru / A Human ManMomomochi Town, where our story takes place, is a fiercely competitive ramen hotspot lined with popular restaurants. One shop drawing particular attention is Meruru Umama-tei, which opened just a year ago.Its owner, Meruru, is a master ramen chef who carries on the tradition of Kotoneko family ramen—a fantastical style passed down on another planet. Alongside this distinctive ramen, whose flavor is no easy feat to recreate, his own original dishes are hugely popular! For Mari","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:09:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1846651706679923","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜Character Introduction｜Mint🍜","summary":"Mint / Zashiki-warashiZashiki-warashi are yokai with a mission: to attach themselves to humans and bring them happiness. They come into the world by falling from the sky, already in adult form. Older members raise the newcomers, and together they live by helping one another.Mint is the youngest of them all—only one year old and still being raised by Niisui. Mischievous and a little cheeky, Mint hates losing and won’t back down, even against senior zashiki-warashi!But behind that competitive stre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T02:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1846018067924870","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜Character Introduction｜Dinette🍜","summary":"Dinette / A Young Human ManLovingly raised by the supernatural being Kagaya, Dinette is a kind soul with a slightly unusual upbringing.What does happiness mean to each person? What does it mean to wish for someone else’s happiness? Dinette is always reflecting on these questions, sincerely seeking to understand others’ feelings and what makes them happy.He shares his heartfelt kindness freely with everyone he meets. That’s why he’s a beloved “prince” to those around him!Dinette himself grew up r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T03:23:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1845383656385197","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜Character Introduction｜Kagaya🍜","summary":"Kagaya / Supernatural BeingAn enormous eye and a terrifying face. If you met Kagaya in the world of this story, you’d probably be frightened at first.But Kagaya himself is kind and sensitive. He loves art, takes life at his own pace, and has a surprisingly playful side.The more time you spend with him, the more familiar his once-frightening appearance becomes. Before they know it, his friends can even read his expressions with ease.Kagaya was once all alone. But raising Dinette made him a father","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T07:04:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1845383656376840","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜 Character Introduction | Niisui 🍜","summary":"Niisui / Zashiki-warashiNiisui is a senior Zashiki-warashi who raised Marilyn.He’s a kind father who lives with his wife and daughter, and a dependable teacher loved and respected by his students.Caring and hardworking, Niisui always gives his all whenever someone relies on him—sometimes a little too much.But even someone who’s always there to support others doesn’t have to face everything alone.With the support of his family, friends, and companions, Niisui learns to take care of himself, too, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T09:12:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1844751498223532","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜 Character Introduction | Sasami🍜","summary":"Sasami / Human WomanA rookie ramen chef who dreams of opening her own ramen shop. She has been honing her skills on her own, learning through practice and determination.After meeting Marilyn and taking him on as her mentor, Sasami’s ramen-making skills begin to improve rapidly!On the “Blue Immortal Planet,” where the story takes place, humans are protected by a special kind of magic.Even when one life comes to an end, they can be reincarnated into another world and begin a brand-new life.Again a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T06:43:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223532","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1844751498220156","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"🍜 Character Introduction | Marilyn 🍜","summary":"Marilyn / Zashiki-warashiZashiki-warashi are yokai with a mission: to attach themselves to humans and bring them happiness.Senior zashiki-warashi guide their juniors, and they all help one another as they live together on the “Blue Immortal Planet,” where the story takes place.And Marilyn, one of those zashiki-warashi, has chosen her own way to bring people happiness:RAMEN!With her flawless makeup and fiery personality, Marilyn is always serious, strong, and cool....But underneath all that makeu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T03:25:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4635180-1844751498217220","game_id":"steam-4635180","kind":"announcement","title":"My Yokai Boyfriend: I LOVE RAMEN! – Release Date Postponement","summary":"Thank you for your continued support of My Yokai Boyfriend: I LOVE RAMEN!The game was originally scheduled to release on Thursday, September 24, 2026. However, we have decided to postpone its release.To deliver the game to everyone in the best possible way, we will use this additional time to further showcase the game's appeal and share more about what makes it special.We will announce the new release date as soon as it has been decided.We sincerely apologize to everyone who has been looking for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T03:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217220","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4635180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4635180":"2026-10-26T13:15:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4635180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:34Z"},"4982410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:35Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4635180","app_id":4635180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:43Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6e37fc6bb6be7d9b20a8abe2e75d71ee8105c4c73a6ca24909e1e187c44328d7","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"「座敷童カレシILOVEラーメン」は、ラーメン作りとハートフルなストーリーを楽しめる”ラブコメノベルゲーム”です。\r\nラーメンで大切なものを守り抜く、強くて優しいストーリー。","publishers":[{"name":"Phoenixx Inc.","creator_clan_account_id":36915405}],"developers":[{"name":"ArabanaNunu"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailer